      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that helps a bit. but i feel like the paddle analogy might be a little too simple for them to really grasp the \"force\" aspect of it. is there any other way to frame the air moving around the wing? maybe something more about the actual physical presence of the air particles themselves hitting the surface or being diverted?",
